    kat "*Durch die Tür* Du bist nackt. Seit dem ersten Kuss..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1313
translate german c30s003_KatWakeUp_f50b8daa:

    # "And you're left alone once again in your room."
    "Und du bist wieder einmal allein in deinem Zimmer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1314
translate german c30s003_KatWakeUp_d3a8be25:

    # "Catching you naked is one of the risks of coming to see you while you sleep."
    "Dich nackt zu erwischen, ist eines der Risiken, wenn man dich im Schlaf besucht."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1316
translate german c30s003_KatWakeUp_e26d63bb:

    # "You fall asleep without realizing it."
    "Du schläfst ein, ohne es zu merken."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1324
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_3691ae9c:

    # "You wake up late and decide to skip breakfast."
    "Du wachst spät auf und beschließt, das Frühstück ausfallen zu lassen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1326
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_db53f178:

    # "You continue preparing things for the trip until lunchtime."
    "Du bereitest bis zum Mittagessen weiter Sachen für die Reise vor."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1327
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_b77dae59:

    # "[nor]'s kitchen is strangely empty."
    "[nor]s Küche ist seltsam leer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1328
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_6f8beb17:

    # "The students are at the university. [eri], [eil], and [sca] are working, while [dap] is at the cafe to give moral support to [sca]."
    "Die Studentinnen sind an der Universität. [eri], [eil] und [sca] arbeiten, während [dap] im Café ist, um [sca] moralisch zu unterstützen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1329
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_19eb09b7:

    # "Of the girls who don't live at home, only [ama] shows up. She's also leaving in a few days, and the conversation revolves around her."
    "Von den Mädchen, die nicht zu Hause wohnen, taucht nur [ama] auf. Sie reist auch in ein paar Tagen ab, und das Gespräch dreht sich um sie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1331
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f5c04bef:

    # "Shortly after lunch..."
    "Kurz nach dem Mittagessen..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1332
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Klopf-Klopf*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1334
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_80ffd8ac:

    # mc "Come in, Mom."
    mc "Komm rein, Mom."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1336
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_55109c40:

    # mc "Come in, [mar]."
    mc "Komm rein, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1340
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_4fffdce8:

    # mom "How did you know it was me?"
    mom "Woher wusstest du, dass ich es bin?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1341
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_64ae1ddb:

    # mc "My door has been knocked on so many times in the last few weeks that I'm starting to recognize how each of your knock's sound."
    mc "In den letzten Wochen wurde so oft an meine Tür geklopft, dass ich langsam erkenne, wie das Klopfen von jedem von euch klingt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1342
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_ba68e24d:

    # mc "Can I help you with something?"
    mc "Kann ich dir bei irgendwas helfen?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1344
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_9d41ecbf:

    # mom "I have to go grocery shopping, and I was wondering if you could come with the truck and bring the groceries back."
    mom "Ich muss einkaufen gehen und habe mich gefragt, ob du mit dem Truck mitkommen und die Einkäufe zurückbringen könntest."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1345
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_62a4b048:

    # mc "*Laugh* Are you buying food for an army?"
    mc "*Lacht* Kaufst du Essen für eine ganze Armee?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1348
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_40c8679a:

    # mom "*Laugh* No, not at all. But I'm going to buy some frozen food, and I won't be coming straight home. I have to stop by the cafe to pick up [dap] and [sca]."
    mom "*Lacht* Nein, ganz und gar nicht. Aber ich werde etwas Tiefkühlkost kaufen und komme nicht direkt nach Hause. Ich muss beim Café vorbeifahren, um [dap] und [sca] abzuholen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1350
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_6bf73d42:

    # mom "*Laugh* No, not at all. But I'm going to buy some frozen food, and I won't be coming straight home. I have to stop by the cafe to pick up [eil], [dap], and [sca]."
    mom "*Lacht* Nein, ganz und gar nicht. Aber ich werde etwas Tiefkühlkost kaufen und komme nicht direkt nach Hause. Ich muss beim Café vorbeifahren, um [eil], [dap] und [sca] abzuholen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1351
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_b35fc70d:

    # mc "If you want, I can go pick them up. I want to see how [sca]'s first day of work went."
    mc "Wenn du willst, kann ich sie abholen. Ich möchte sehen, wie [sca]s erster Arbeitstag gelaufen ist."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1353
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_a6cb4850:

    # mom "Well, I have to take [dap] and [sca] shopping. I promised them a few days ago. Why don't you pick up [eil] and bring the groceries home?"
    mom "Nun, ich muss mit [dap] und [sca] shoppen gehen. Das habe ich ihnen vor ein paar Tagen versprochen. Warum holst du nicht [eil] ab und bringst die Einkäufe nach Hause?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1354
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_b81a46df:

    # mc "Sounds like a good idea. That way I can ask [sca] before you guys go shopping."
    mc "Klingt nach einer guten Idee. So kann ich [sca] fragen, bevor ihr shoppen geht."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1355
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_9e0a40a8:

    # mc "We can leave whenever you want."
    mc "Wir können los, wann immer du willst."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1357
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_2e27fb9a:

    # "In the end, you don't buy any frozen food, and you and [mar] can go pick up the girls."
    "Am Ende kaufst du keine Tiefkühlkost, und du und [mar] könnt die Mädchen abholen gehen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1358
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_390286cd:

    # "You're both eager to see how [sca]'s first day of work went."
    "Ihr seid beide gespannt darauf, wie [sca]s erster Arbeitstag gelaufen ist."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1359
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_4b21d8db:

    # "You arrive a few minutes before [eil] and [sca] finish their shift."
    "Ihr kommt ein paar Minuten, bevor [eil] und [sca] ihre Schicht beenden, an."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1360
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_c3ded746:

    # "You find the cafe darker than usual, but there don't seem to be any burnt-out lights."
    "Das Café ist dunkler als sonst, aber es scheinen keine Lampen durchgebrannt zu sein."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1362
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f97beb57:

    # "So as not to bother [sca], you decide to go keep [dap] company."
    "Um [sca] nicht zu stören, beschließt du, [dap] Gesellschaft zu leisten."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1363
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_eda662ef:

    # mc "Hey, [dap]. How's [sca] doing?"
    mc "Hey, [dap]. Wie schlägt sich [sca]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1364
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_a6cc2eb5:

    # dap "Better than we all expected. She hasn't broken anything. *Laugh*"
    dap "Besser als wir alle erwartet haben. Sie hat noch nichts kaputt gemacht. *Lacht*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1366
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_786d3bf5:

    # mom "I'm going to order a coffee. I want to try the coffee [sca] makes so I can compare it to the ones [eil] and [eri] make."
    mom "Ich werde mir einen Kaffee bestellen. Ich will den Kaffee probieren, den [sca] macht, um ihn mit dem von [eil] und [eri] zu vergleichen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1367
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_bacc7474:

    # mom "Do you want anything, [mc]?"
    mom "Möchtest du auch etwas, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1368
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_9fcb42e1:

    # mc "*Laugh* I knew you wouldn't be able to resist. Order an espresso for me, please."
    mc "*Lacht* Ich wusste, dass du nicht widerstehen kannst. Bestell mir bitte einen Espresso."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1371
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_85fff413:

    # mc "*Laugh* I see you played it safe and ordered a water."
    mc "*Lacht* Ich sehe, du bist auf Nummer sicher gegangen und hast ein Wasser bestellt."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1372
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_9881e221:

    # dap "*Laugh* That was only after the first four coffees."
    dap "*Lacht* Das war erst nach den ersten vier Kaffees."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1373
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_5ab77f72:

    # dap "I intend to be able to sleep tonight, or this week... I'm not used to drinking so much coffee."
    dap "Ich habe vor, heute Nacht schlafen zu können, oder diese Woche... Ich bin es nicht gewohnt, so viel Kaffee zu trinken."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1374
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_7aaff76c:

    # mc "So, everything's good with the first day at work, right?"
    mc "Also, alles gut mit dem ersten Arbeitstag, oder?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1376
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f69e5224:

    # dap "Yeah, she seems really excited. All these days she's spent here have given her a lot of confidence."
    dap "Ja, sie scheint wirklich aufgeregt zu sein. All die Tage, die sie hier verbracht hat, haben ihr viel Selbstvertrauen gegeben."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1377
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_e3e3e49f:

    # dap "Do you remember how shy she was when you arrived from Portland?"
    dap "Erinnerst du dich, wie schüchtern sie war, als du aus Portland angekommen bist?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1378
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_70acd1d4:

    # mc "I think that version of [sca] is a thing of the past. Moving home has done her a lot of good."
    mc "Ich glaube, diese Version von [sca] gehört der Vergangenheit an. Der Umzug nach Hause hat ihr sehr gutgetan."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1381
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f8ec25b3:

    # dap "Being surrounded by girls she didn't know well has been good for her also. And dating you too."
    dap "Von Mädchen umgeben zu sein, die sie nicht gut kannte, war auch gut für sie. Und dich zu daten ebenfalls."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1383
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_7acc6f89:

    # dap "Being surrounded by girls she didn't know well has been good for her also. It forced her to open up."
    dap "Von Mädchen umgeben zu sein, die sie nicht gut kannte, war auch gut für sie. Es hat sie gezwungen, sich zu öffnen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1384
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f92e4734:

    # mc "And what about the exhaustion? [eil] told me the first few days can be exhausting."
    mc "Und was ist mit der Erschöpfung? [eil] hat mir gesagt, dass die ersten paar Tage anstrengend sein können."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1386
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_4ccc469d:

    # dap "You can ask her yourself. She's coming over with the coffees."
    dap "Du kannst sie selbst fragen. Sie kommt gerade mit den Kaffees rüber."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1387
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_c3232a1f:

    # mc "Right on time."
    mc "Genau pünktlich."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1390
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_5716410f:

    # sca "Here's your coffee, Sir."
    sca "Hier ist Ihr Kaffee, Sir."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1392
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_d9601f57:

    # sca "And your wife's coffee. *Giggle*"
    sca "Und der Kaffee für Ihre Frau. *Kichert*"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1394
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_28f87d28:

    # sca "And the lady's coffee."
    sca "Und der Kaffee für die Dame."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1395
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_f28a1a11:

    # mc "Thanks. How formal!"
    mc "Danke. Wie formell!"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1397
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_1349362e:

    # sca "[eil] told me to treat everyone with the utmost respect, even if I know them."
    sca "[eil] hat mir gesagt, ich soll jeden mit höchstem Respekt behandeln, auch wenn ich ihn kenne."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1398
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_efccaa80:

    # sca "Some people don't like it when servers treat them with familiarity."
    sca "Manche Leute mögen es nicht, wenn Bedienungen zu vertraut mit ihnen umgehen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1399
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_ea3e765d:

    # mc "Well, you can treat me like you always do."
    mc "Nun, du kannst mich behandeln wie immer."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1401
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_af5adb87:

    # mc "Though I guess you're not going to give me a kiss today. At least until your shift is over."
    mc "Obwohl ich schätze, dass du mir heute keinen Kuss geben wirst. Zumindest bis deine Schicht vorbei ist."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1403
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_1ab95daa:

    # dap "*Laugh* She barely let me hug her when she brought me the first coffee."
    dap "*Lacht* Sie hat mich kaum umarmen lassen, als sie mir den ersten Kaffee gebracht hat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1404
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_d8d24527:

    # dap "But you know I can be very persistent with hugs."
    dap "Aber du weißt ja, dass ich bei Umarmungen sehr hartnäckig sein kann."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1405
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_de5e31ec:

    # mc "*Laugh* That runs in the family."
    mc "*Lacht* Das liegt in der Familie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1407
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_a2c0726b:

    # mc "[dap] told me the day is going well. Are you very tired?"
    mc "[dap] hat mir gesagt, dass der Tag gut läuft. Bist du sehr müde?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1408
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_e2e7b78c:

    # sca "More than I thought, but also very happy. No one has complained about my coffee."
    sca "Mehr als ich dachte, aber auch sehr glücklich. Niemand hat sich über meinen Kaffee beschwert."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1409
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_c39bcab7:

    # sca "And I don't think they'll have many opportunities to complain. I only have a few minutes left until I finish my shift."
    sca "Und ich glaube nicht, dass sie noch viele Gelegenheiten haben werden, sich zu beschweren. Ich habe nur noch ein paar Minuten, bis meine Schicht vorbei ist."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1410
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_a3c2a228:

    # mc "Then we won't keep you any longer. *Laugh* I'll tell you later if I have any complaints about the coffee."
    mc "Dann halten wir dich nicht länger auf. *Lacht* Ich sag dir später, ob ich mich über den Kaffee beschweren muss."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1412
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_8a68e923:

    # "After a few seconds, [mar] returns from the counter, where she stayed talking to [eil]."
    "Nach ein paar Sekunden kommt [mar] vom Tresen zurück, wo sie sich noch mit [eil] unterhalten hat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1413
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_09ecaefd:

    # "You look at each other reluctantly before tasting the coffee [sca] made."
    "Ihr seht euch widerwillig an, bevor ihr den Kaffee probiert, den [sca] gemacht hat."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1415
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_ae213fc8:

    # mom "It's... surprisingly good. I like how [eri] makes it better, but it's not bad at all for the first day."
    mom "Er ist... überraschend gut. Ich mag es lieber, wie [eri] ihn macht, aber für den ersten Tag ist er gar nicht schlecht."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1416
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_564e1634:

    # mc "I prefer how [eil] makes my coffee, but it's better than I expected."
    mc "Ich bevorzuge es, wie [eil] meinen Kaffee macht, aber er ist besser, als ich erwartet habe."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1418
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_cfaa211a:

    # dap "I find your lack of faith disturbing! *Laugh* I've always wanted to say that line."
    dap "Ich finde euren Mangel an Glauben beklagenswert! *Lacht* Den Spruch wollte ich schon immer mal bringen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1419
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_5d480278:

    # mc "*Laugh* As long as you don't tell me you're my father..."
    mc "*Lacht* Solange du mir nicht erzählst, dass du mein Vater bist..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1420
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_2a65a43d:

    # mc "By the way, what are you guys going to buy?"
    mc "Übrigens, was werdet ihr euch kaufen?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1422
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_1cb6b656:

    # dap "Some clothes and a few other things. You know, we start college in a few weeks..."
    dap "Ein paar Klamotten und ein paar andere Sachen. Du weißt schon, wir fangen in ein paar Wochen mit dem College an..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1423
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_37a56058:

    # mc "What's wrong with your clothes? I like them."
    mc "Was stimmt mit euren Klamotten nicht? Ich mag sie."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1425
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_ce315d81:

    # mom "A girl must have clothes for all occasions, [mc]. You should know that by now."
    mom "Ein Mädchen muss Kleidung für alle Gelegenheiten haben, [mc]. Das solltest du mittlerweile wissen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1426
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_7cab744c:

    # mc "*Laugh* Yeah, for all possible occasions and the impossible ones too."
    mc "*Lacht* Ja, für alle möglichen Gelegenheiten und auch für die unmöglichen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1427
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_e60c40fd:

    # mc "Don't forget to buy the diving suit and the astronaut suit."
    mc "Vergesst nicht, den Taucheranzug und den Astronautenanzug zu kaufen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1429
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_038b0d11:

    # eil "Is he complaining about us buying too much clothes again?"
    eil "Beschwert er sich schon wieder darüber, dass wir zu viele Klamotten kaufen?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1430
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_43263d03:

    # mc "I'm not complaining. Just asking. Are you done with your shift?"
    mc "Ich beschwere mich nicht. Ich frage nur. Bist du fertig mit deiner Schicht?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1432
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_8154d598:

    # eil "Yeah. [sca] is changing and we can leave whenever you want."
    eil "Ja. [sca] zieht sich gerade um und wir können los, wann immer du willst."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1433
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_879194b2:

    # mc "Aren't you taking off your uniform?"
    mc "Ziehst du deine Uniform nicht aus?"

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1434
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_0eb0f714:

    # eil "My locker is bursting with [eri]'s and [sca]'s things, so I just go to and from home in my uniform."
    eil "Mein Spind platzt aus allen Nähten mit den Sachen von [eri] und [sca], also gehe ich einfach in meiner Uniform zur Arbeit und wieder nach Hause."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1435
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_8f09afec:

    # mc "I thought sharing your locker was exactly so you wouldn't have to do that..."
    mc "Ich dachte, du teilst dir deinen Spind genau aus dem Grund, damit du das nicht tun musst..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1437
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_92e7a3cd:

    # mom "You're very picky about clothes today. If [eil] wants to go home in her uniform, she has every right to do so."
    mom "Du bist heute sehr pingelig, was Kleidung angeht. Wenn [eil] in ihrer Uniform nach Hause gehen will, hat sie jedes Recht dazu."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1438
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_fc1bc674:

    # mc "I wasn't saying..."
    mc "Das wollte ich damit nicht sagen..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1440
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_e16903e6:

    # dap "Here comes [sca]. She did change. You must be happy, [mc]."
    dap "Da kommt [sca]. Sie hat sich umgezogen. Du musst ja glücklich sein, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1441
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_bb3e3d13:

    # mc "I don't care, it just seems weird to me..."
    mc "Ist mir egal, es kommt mir nur komisch vor..."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1443
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_c68a1c6e:

    # sca "Shall we go? I'm looking forward to seeing that... store... you told us about."
    sca "Wollen wir los? Ich freue mich schon darauf, diesen... Laden... zu sehen, von dem du uns erzählt hast."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1444
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_b918d045:

    # mc "I won't make any comments about how I thought you bought your clothes at [mad.nick]'s store."
    mc "Ich werde keinen Kommentar darüber abgeben, dass ich dachte, du kaufst deine Klamotten in [mad.nick]s Laden."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1445
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_b2cf60dc:

    # mc "I'm sure you'd get defensive."
    mc "Ich bin mir sicher, du würdest gleich in die Defensive gehen."

# game/scripts/c30/c30.rpy:1447
translate german c30s003_MarShopping_6610e4d8:

    # "After saying your goodbyes, you and [eil] head back home while the rest of the women go shopping."
